import Scry.AiDomain
import Scry.AiCfg
import Scry.AiFixpoint
/-!
# Scry.Ai: the abstract-interpretation core

The parser-free core of stage S5 (design `wiz-notes/code-analysis-design.md` §4.6,
§5.3): lattice/domain/transfer interfaces, unsigned machine intervals with constants and
nullness, a widening worklist, narrowing, overflow/out-of-bounds/nullness alarms, and
the post-fixpoint checker. See `wiz-notes/scry-ai.md`.

`import Scry.Ai` gives the interfaces and the engine; tests and examples use
`Scry.AiExamples` (`lib/Scry/AiExamples.wiz`). Nothing here imports Wil or tree-sitter.

```
import Scry.Ai

#eval accepts (AiMach.mk 8) cfg inv   -- the checker's verdict on a post-fixpoint
```
-/
